  "title": "Slow Cooker Scalloped Potatoes",
  "description": "These slow cooker scalloped potatoes are easy to make with sliced potatoes and garlic in a homemade sauce for a deliciously cheesy side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Kattygirl"
  ],
